<title>SINGAPORE: Wong's Circuits 1996 net up 14.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Wong's Circuits 1996 net up 14.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     26.43 vs  23.16</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)		  18.92 vs  16.78</p>
<p>    Turnover				168.77 vs 143.03</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	 1.62 vs   0.79</p>
<p>    Interest expense			0.43 vs   0.41</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortisation	   8.95 vs   7.65</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 31.95 vs  27.62</p>
<p>    Tax					 4.17 vs   3.58</p>
<p>    Minorities (gain)		     1.35 vs   0.88</p>
<p>Note - Wong's circuits makes printed circuit boards for the electronics industry. Its shares were listed on the Stock Exchange of Singapore in December 1996.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
